00:21:05,560 --> 00:21:06,720
 Right, I must be off now.

252
00:21:07,540 --> 00:21:09,190
 I also have to go, my friend,

253
00:21:09,250 --> 00:21:10,770
 but I promise I'll come and visit you again

254
00:21:10,770 --> 00:21:12,440
 as soon as I have a free moment, okay?

255
00:21:12,980 --> 00:21:13,500
 Okay.

256
00:21:13,880 --> 00:21:15,400
 Bring me some more chocolates, right?

257
00:21:16,930 --> 00:21:26,310
 Don't you think you should start eating a bit less?

258
00:21:26,550 --> 00:21:28,310
 But what else is there to do in bed?

259
00:21:28,450 --> 00:21:29,830
 Well, if I were in your place,

260
00:21:29,870 --> 00:21:31,050
 I'd be doing some studying.

261
00:21:31,670 --> 00:21:33,510
 I'd use the time more constructively.

262
00:21:34,080 --> 00:21:35,420
 Would you like me to bring you some books?

263
00:21:36,780 --> 00:21:38,390
 You're getting fat, my friend.

264
00:21:38,470 --> 00:21:39,330
 You must watch it.

265
00:21:46,800 --> 00:21:54,390
 You're so heavy. I don't know why. It's getting harder to move.

266
00:21:54,530 --> 00:21:58,230
 I'm also struggling, and I don't know why. It was so easy a while ago.

267
00:21:58,730 --> 00:22:02,000
 Hang on. I've suddenly realized what it is that's causing all the trouble.

268
00:22:02,260 --> 00:22:03,820
 It's all this fat, that's what.

269
00:22:09,640 --> 00:22:22,210
 Am I supposed to do with all this fat, especially when we're having to produce so little energy?

270
00:22:22,800 --> 00:22:24,080
 You know what to do?

271
00:22:24,640 --> 00:22:27,600
 Okay. About turn. You must go back to the stocks.

272
00:22:27,920 --> 00:22:29,560
 We'll call for you only if we need. You understood?

273
00:22:29,760 --> 00:22:34,420
 If you break like that, of course I'm going to run into you, idiot.

274
00:22:34,810 --> 00:22:36,480
 It's all your stupid fault.

275
00:22:36,830 --> 00:22:38,620
 It isn't. It was you who accelerated.

276
00:22:39,790 --> 00:22:46,340
 GET BACK TO YOUR VEHICLES! WE'VE ENOUGH PROBLEMS WITHOUT THIS SORT OF THING!

277
00:22:46,340 --> 00:23:03,810
 More fat! Stop immediately!

278
00:23:03,810 --> 00:23:07,740
 We're destroyed any second now!

279
00:23:07,740 --> 00:23:10,610
 Oh! We've been sunk by the enemy!

280
00:23:10,610 --> 00:23:14,260
 Oh! Oh! Oh! Oh!

281
00:23:14,260 --> 00:23:20,470
 Plumpeting towards the cell wall, we're in danger of becoming another fat cell!

282
00:23:20,470 --> 00:23:24,370
 That won't do at all!

283
00:23:24,370 --> 00:23:27,330
 Do you realize you're putting a dead weight on your poor spine?

284
00:23:27,330 --> 00:23:31,450
 That's the equivalent of carrying a load of 20 kilograms on your shoulders, my dear boy!

285
00:23:31,450 --> 00:23:36,650
 Not to mention the heart and the lungs getting exhausted from looking after mountains of fat.

286
00:23:36,990 --> 00:23:39,870
 No, no, no, no. This has all got to stop.

287
00:23:40,560 --> 00:23:45,080
 You're to start getting some exercise, and from now on you're only to eat grilled meats and salads.

288
00:23:45,380 --> 00:23:49,180
 All you need is a bit of courage and willpower. You'll be all right, you'll see.

